DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Free General Admissio
 n\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nJoin us for a screening of WTT
 W’s The World’s Fair of 1893 . Then\, explore the museum to find piece
 s from the World’s Fair on display today! Plus\, enter a draw for your c
 hance to receive a 1-year complimentary WTTW membership at the WTTW Passpo
 rt level. The Field Museum and WTTW are partnering to present WTTW First W
 ednesdays! With free general admission for Illinois Residents on the first
  Wednesday of every month\, you can spend your day exploring Earth's 4.5 b
 illion years of history. Hear from scientists and experts\, meet Máximo t
 he Titanosaur\, the largest creature to ever roam Earth\, step into the wo
 rld of SUE the T. rex\, explore rich histories of ancient civilizations\, 
 and more!\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/wttw-firs
 t-wednesdays/wttw-first-wednesday-2026-11-04
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
URL:https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/wttw-first-wednesdays/wttw-firs
 t-wednesday-2026-11-04
